      "body": "Firebase Auth with local emulator (password, e-mail link, phone, OAuth popup,\nSMS/TOTP MFA, server session, safe logout), application-owned Firebase UI\ncomponents (ADRs 0004-0006), en/pt/es i18n synced to Firestore, and Firestore\nwith persistent local cache, security rules and sign-out cache clearing\n(ADR 0008, partially implemented).\n\nNot included: exams, study data and the profile consumer.\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ianmaciel7/notes-app/compare/v0.2.0...v0.3.0\n"
